Dialogue: 1000,0:01:55.21,0:01:59.23,Title,,0,0,0,,{=10001}{\pos(1817.4,909.4)\fad(380,500)\bord1\blur6\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Whirlwind, Himari, Roar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aims to be more cohesive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor that the 7th\NSquadron's second-in-command
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fainted when she was attacked\Nby one of the humanoid Shuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're determined to drag the Azuma family's\Nreputation through the mud, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up and come home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to be fair, those\NShuuki aren't exactly weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 3rd Squadron had a\Nrun-in with them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just once, but two times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strength in numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us working together would be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We find your presence at battle\Nreassuring, Commander Kyoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But some of us are a little hesitant\Nto put our trust in your entire team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:02:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't name any names.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're concerned that her\Nimpotence might slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to assess the current\Ncapabilities of each of our teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we hold an\Ninter-squad-mato exhibition match?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mato exhibition match?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, a baseball league?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An exhibition match is\Nwhat we call a contest
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of strength and skill\Nbetween two squadrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does single combat sound acceptable?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have never been the type\Nto mince words, have you, Kyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll adjust our numbers accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, little slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander, I have a request?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you help me prepare\Nfor the exhibition?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be physically demanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it\Ntakes to win the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'd better buckle\Ndown and start training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard the commander. I, Himari Azuma,\Nclaim you as my slave from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki's ramen broth is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, it's so good I always end\Nup eating too much of his cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you use some sort\Nof secret ingredient?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted it to be rich and thick this\Ntime, so I tried adding chicken fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skills are perfect for a slave if\Nyou're good at cleaning and cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please remind me again how\NI got roped into being your slave too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for the sake of the\NMato exhibition match.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely imperative that I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't explain why\NI'm being forced to be your...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping it simple this\Ntime with single combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your sister's attitude\Nstruck a nerve, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:05:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can use this match\Nas an excuse to kick her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the chance\Nto do some ass kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ass kicking is your new job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll kick it, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the kicking and ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still haven't answered my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I your slave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transforming parts of my body into\Nweapons isn't my main ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only use it because\Nit's compatible. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my real technique.
