Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can learn other people's\Nabilities and use them for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.91,0:05:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that ability super OP?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I select someone's talents that I want\Nto use on my phone and implement it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What that means is, I can\Nuse the Commanders now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do understand what Miss Kyoka's\Nability entails, right? Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aware it's physically demanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind taking\Nover the cleaning or the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,laundry if it means I get\Nto kick Yachi-ho's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded by Shuuki! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine, but I warned you!
