Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.54,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{=10055}{\pos(718.85,733.25)\blur0.8\fs290\c&H6F7473&\frz0.03265}SLAVE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a different shape than\Nwhen the Commander does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can move with lightning speed!\NEven faster than with Miss Kyouka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the drawback is\Nthat I'm not as strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just beat on them till they drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the key to fighting my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can pick from any number of abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why you insist on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.61,0:07:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gives you a chance to be\Nuseful even though you're a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, you ought to be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the price of her ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, by physically demanding,\Nshe really meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, how come I can't\Ncontrol my body movement?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's because my\Nreward isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, why does your reward have to be this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.99,0:07:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, quit cocking\Nat me already, you perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would, but if I do that, you might...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.47,0:07:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought, just see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the price of her ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it won't stop until I get my reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.55,0:08:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a sufficient?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough reward for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How indecent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would be better off using a different
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I would if I could, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So shameful wait but\Nwhy can't you there's a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,compatibility component to\Nlearning it degrades the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quality of most abilities\Nto the point they become
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,useless. For example, if\NI were to use Shushu's
