Dialogue: 16,0:08:43.68,0:08:51.14,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=10050}{\pos(472.27,793.76)\bord2\fax-0.55\fscy180\fs21\fnFOT-ModeMinALarge Std R\blur1.4\3c&HDFE7F5&\c&H3F3149&\frz4.417Mato Destruction Power}Mato Destruction Power
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,paradigm shift all it\Nwould do is increase my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bus size by about three\Ncentimeters okay but the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,price of miss kyoka's\Nability is i'm aware of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:09:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that okay why are you\Nso desperate to win this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm from the Azuma household an influential\Nfamily with major accomplishments
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in mato my older sisters are successful\Nso everyone had high hopes for me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too but i'd overexert myself before\Na big event and get hurt or i'd get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.23,0:09:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nervous and come down with a fever i\Nnever had any results to show for it yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,story of my life same\Nwith my peach ability i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.01,0:09:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guessing they noticed the\Nproblem you mentioned earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of that i'd\Nalways get teased whenever
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't keep up with my sisters. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it must have been tough for you growing up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is my first chance\Nsince i cut ties with
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.85,0:09:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the azuma family to\Nprove them wrong about me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you are going to help\Nme and be happy about it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's really hard to want\Nto help someone when they
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't even ask politely\Nas for my ultimate goal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i want to be a hero like\Nthe commander i feel
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like i'll become a better\Nversion of myself if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can beat Yachiho. That part of me that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nobody's ever seen deserves\Na proper chance to shine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's just like me still we're missing\Nsomething for the exhibition match?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A finishing move that\Nwill demolish our enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all I've done so far is mindlessly\Npunch and kick everything in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have my own reasons for\Nwanting to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's the key to opening\Nup a new door for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even better if I manage\Nto help Miss Kyoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my slave, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have the right to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what Yachiho's ability is?
