Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ears are burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a sneaking suspicion\NHimari is talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me right now Oh Himari such\Na worthless little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only right that she does my bidding\Nfor the rest of her miserable life
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to put her in her\Nplace at the exhibition match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for the big day to arrive.
