Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yachi-ho's ability is dangerous\Nfor sure, but it takes power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll get tired if she uses it too\Nmany times, and that's how we'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that she can use it more\Nthan once makes things tricky, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, she strikes a very odd\Npose to trigger her ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a routine that emphasizes her skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then we'll have to\Nbeat her to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, we ought to take advantage\Nof my speed for our finishing move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ultra-fast maneuver that won't\Ngive her a chance to freeze time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no leeway to rewind time either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An attack with enough force to knock\Nher out of the fight completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, like, a swift step\Nforward into a head-on punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that would be fastest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's polish it into a\Ndeadly blow she can't dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to try channeling all your\Nstrength into a single part of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my strength to my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in time for our\Npractice dummies to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm even faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're golden!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why didn't it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lower half is exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:13:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably lost most\Nof your arm strength
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you poured all\Nyour energy into your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, we'll keep experimenting with\Nit until we perfect your technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, is this my reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he does look different\Nthan when he's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyouka, keep it up. Roger! Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Channeling his strength into a single body\Npart to produce a more powerful effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a proactive approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a knack for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thank you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being said, why are you\Nwatching him from way back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't forget the fundamental\Nessence of my ability. Its essence?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.68,0:13:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be riding you during the exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this like it's the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ability requires dominating a slave,\Nnot just standing back and coaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:13:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on top of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize the slave's chains and\Ncommand him as his master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Channel all your strength into your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel more power flowing\Nthrough me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go crush that Shuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did I really just do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A foolproof finishing move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got lost in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I can replicate\Nthat. Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mato has plenty of\Npractice dummies to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a million times more\Nworn out than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your technique lacks precision sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to practice and\Ndevelop consistency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.09,0:14:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the price of her ability, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indecent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Shuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna master this technique so I\Ncan put it into use again in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
