Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel good that's great,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but once the exhibition is done\Nthe Himariyuki duel will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so after all he\Nbelongs to the commander
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not me and it's a physically\Ndemanding ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, let's focus on today. The whole\NDemon Defense Force will know who won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the outcome will affect our\Nsquadrons' the commander's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to put our\Nbest foot forward. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both for myself and the commander,\Nsince she organized this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, aren't the other members\Nof the Six Squadron supposed to show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.99,0:16:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got here a little early,\Nso I came to de-stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when was she in the Six Squadron?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Sahara Wakasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a homebody, so it's rare to\Nsee her out and about like this.
Dialogue: 11,0:17:15.56,0:17:22.53,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{=39590}{\pos(1443.24,809.37)\fs120\blur0.5\c&H0B9726&}WAKASA
