Dialogue: 11,0:17:15.56,0:17:22.53,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{=39589}{\pos(1491.63,899.55)\fs120\blur0.5\c&H0B9726&}SAHARA
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.56,0:17:22.53,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{=10037}{\pos(1500.21,898.69)\fs120\blur0.5\c&H093C2C&}SAHARA
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now she's asleep? How funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's certainly got guts, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll do great, Himari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking a bath before the exhibition match?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be feeling awfully confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to be clean and\Nwell-groomed when I win today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you've got a plan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the question is, can\Nyou actually pull it off?
