Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you still haven't left the dorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The match is supposed to start soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only delaying the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, remember, we trained our asses off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awfully cocky for a slave. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously, we're guaranteed to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Write your name down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's used to trigger\NGina Beezin's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.31,0:18:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can create a barrier by drawing a line\Non the ground that acts as a boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only those who sign their\Nnames can enter the barrier.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.36,0:18:49.03,Signs - Style 1,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(-56,1698.4)\pos(1771.7,373.03)\blur1\fs130\fry2.52\frx1.99\frz-5.31\fax0.3\c&H1A0610&}Himari
