Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.36,0:18:50.28,Signs - Style 1,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(934.5,1104.7)\pos(919.98,556.22)\fax0.37\blur1\fs120\c&H1A0610&\\fry4.15\frx8.87\frz55.71\c&H1C0A17&}Yuuki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, any damage sustained during combat\Ninside the barrier will be healed.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.28,0:18:50.37,Signs - Style 1,,0,0,0,,{\an7\org(934.5,1104.7)\pos(919.98,556.22)\fax0.37\blur1\fs120\c&H1A0610&\\fry4.15\frx8.87\frz55.71\iclip(m 640.75 818.49 l 637.36 813.58 638.87 807.55 636.6 803.4 633.58 799.62 627.55 798.11 621.51 795.85 620.38 789.81 619.25 786.42 615.09 783.4 610.19 785.66 604.53 789.06 602.26 789.81 596.98 790.94 589.81 793.21 586.42 796.6 581.89 796.98 580.75 794.34 583.02 785.66 583.4 771.32 581.51 767.55 583.77 762.64 584.53 759.62 584.15 755.85 580.75 751.7 579.25 747.92 595.47 696.01 681.24 682.21 732.02 708.33 752.23 747.77 765.54 789.67)\c&H1C0A17&}Yuuki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Gina Bizen of the 10th Squadron,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:19:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll be your rep for today's\NInner Squad Exhibition Match.
