Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ability of mine is\Nlike a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get to see the demon defense\Nforce up close and personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not everyone believes\NPeach's cramped power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is based on the person's\Nnature and knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I totally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This barrier could withstand\Nthe force of a thousand Shuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you to judge this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Lady Ten and Lady Kyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Kyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a fangirl or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really need to shut the hell up.
