Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari Azuma of the seventh squadron\Nversus Yachiho Azuma of the sixth squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:20:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules are whoever gives up\Nor gets knocked out first loses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Injuries will be healed,\Nso feel free to go nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I humiliate you, I'm\Ngoing to drag you back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.49,0:20:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be my special little servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same person I was back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.27,0:20:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will defeat you, Yachiho.
