Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As part of my ability,\Nhe's going to assist me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Denying a dog handler her\Npup is just plain heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let the first match begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.49,0:20:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't last a second again.
