Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We planned ahead in case we couldn't\Nbeat her with a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stick to our strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She changed tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it an accident or\Ndid she do it on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.07,0:21:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Himari, you haven't realized\Nmy ability has gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an indisputable fact that little\Nsisters can't beat big sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll prove it to you with prime time!
